# Binary assets and test fixtures: never convert line endings. Git for Windows checks out with
# core.autocrlf=true, and a binary file without NUL bytes (for example a PPM reference image)
# would otherwise be treated as text and get CRLFs.
*.ppm binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.bmp binary
*.wav binary
*.flac binary
*.ogg binary
*.opus binary
*.mp3 binary
*.spv binary
*.bin binary
*.dvox binary
*.dvepak binary
*.dvesample binary
*.dvepixel binary
*.dfluoddity binary
